WEBVTT

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.150
Florence at the beginning of the 16th century--

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:38.780
At that time, countries from
Italy to western Europe

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:42.980
were welcoming the golden age of
the revival of Greek and Roman culture.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:48.030
It was called the Renaissance,
and in the painting world,

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:54.280
it produced great painters
like da Vinci and Michelangelo.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.070
I overslept!

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:02.530
Ow...

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.860
Good morning, Master!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:08.820
Um, I'll do my best starting today!

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:14.400
Um... Leo? Is there something
you'd like me to help with?

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.530
You're too loud.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.440
You're keeping me from my work.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:31.530
"Buy materials to fix your
shed with this money."

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:35.860
If you want to become an artisan,
then you should do that yourself.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.690
Master... He really is scary...

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.900
No, don't go down that road!
Keep moving forward, Arte!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:26.510
"A New Life"

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:25.480
Fresh fish! Caught in the
Arno River this morning!

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.570
How about some tripe?
It's delicious!

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:28.900
Do you need fire?

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.530
If the fire at your house has
gone out, come talk to me!

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:37.440
I, Arte, have loved to draw since I was young,
and going against my mother's wishes,

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:43.070
I was finally accepted as an apprentice
at a small workshop, but...

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.900
It's my first time at the marketplace!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.480
Hey, cutie! How about a skewer?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:54.190
I'll sell these necklaces
and bracelets for cheap!

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:57.150
Miss, would you like a flower?

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.730
M-Maybe I can look around first...

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:03.650
Wait, I don't have time for this!

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:07.230
Huh? Do we have any extra wood?

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:12.570
Well, I can sell you some,
but don't cause trouble for us.

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.980
I-I won't!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.650
A girl like you doing repairs?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.110
Why don't you just seduce someone
into doing it for you?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.940
Can you carry all that wood
with those skinny arms of yours?

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:31.980
It's heavy...

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.150
His load looks so heavy, too...

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.110
I see...

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.570
I can't just push with my arms.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:48.320
I need to put my back into it, too.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.480
What's with that girl?

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.610
What's she doing, even though she's a girl?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.610
Oh, dear.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:06.190
It's because she's pushing herself
even though she's a girl.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:08.530
Don't try so hard, Missy.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.820
It... doesn't hurt...!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.480
I can't cry...

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.860
Then people'll say it's because I'm a girl.

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:23.280
A boy wouldn't cry in a place like this!

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:26.530
Um, are you all right?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.570
Whoa, you're hurt all over!

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:32.940
There's a well over there,
so let's wash your wounds out there!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.530
All right, now your wounds are clean.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.150
Hm? What's the matter?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.190
--Um... My hand...
--Your hand?

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:51.780
It's the first time a boy's
held my hand like this...

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:57.860
Sorry! I-I-I-I see! That was rude
of me! I'm really very sorry!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:02.230
It's all right. Please, don't apologize.

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:05.860
You treated me so kindly. It made me happy.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:12.280
Because everyone I met was so cold to me...

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:17.690
I-It was nothing... I was just
doing what was natural...

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.650
Oh, yeah. I haven't introduced
myself yet, have I?

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:21.860
Introduced yourself?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.780
Yeah! I'm Angelo. Angelo Parker!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:30.230
I'm working as an apprentice at
Master Danilo's painting workshop.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:33.900
At Master Danilo's?
That's a really big workshop, isn't it?

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:35.280
You know a lot!

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:39.780
I also just became an apprentice
at a workshop--at Leo's place.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:40.820
Huh?!

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.940
Oh, I'm Arte.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.320
<i>You're</i> the one the rumors are about?

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:46.230
Rumors?

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:51.190
All the painters are talking about it!
That <i>that</i> Leo took on an apprentice.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.360
And a girl to boot.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:55.360
A girl... People are talking that much...?

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:58.570
Are you being treated badly in any way?

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:02.230
I heard that he gave you an impossible task
as the condition for becoming an apprentice.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:07.320
Oh, he told me to prepare
20 wood panels in one night...

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.280
That's terrible...

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:13.110
Could it be that carrying
that is your work, too?

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:16.070
Yeah... I guess you could call it work...

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:21.110
What? That's too much!
A girl can't be expected to carry that!

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:24.530
All right! I'll help you carry it!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.400
I'm fine.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.190
I can do it by myself.

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:33.190
You don't have to hold back.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:36.280
I'm pretty strong, despite how I look.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.780
Huh? Y-Y-Your hand...!

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:44.070
Angelo, please don't.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:45.190
Huh?

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:54.940
Um... Huh? Did I do something wrong?

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:57.150
I was finally made an apprentice.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.480
I can't depend on others
just because I'm a girl.

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.440
These are really getting in the way...

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.650
Hey, look.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.900
Oh my, how unseemly for a girl!

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:22.820
"There's no way a girl could carry this,"

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.820
or, "There's no way a girl
could become a painter,"

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:28.440
or, "If you want to live a decent life,

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.530
then your only choice is
to be liked by gentlemen."

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.940
What the heck?!

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.940
I'm going to decide how I'll live myself.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.690
The world has no right to determine my limits!

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:45.440
Oof!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:02.190
All right! I finished it!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:04.150
It took a week, though...

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.820
Oh, are you finally done?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.650
Yes! I finally finished!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:14.900
What do you think? What do you
think of my workmanship?

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.530
Hmm.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.690
What do you mean, "Hmm"?

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.940
You can do it if you try, huh?

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:33.690
"For a girl"... or,
"Even though you're a girl"...

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.940
He would never say anything like that.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.820
Ever since I first met him,

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:43.980
he always looked at me as my
own person, not just as a girl.

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:51.650
I'm just trying to keep my tears in,
so please don't worry about it.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:56.070
"Keeping his laughter in"

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:01.980
During this time, in order to become a painter,
one had to go through a number of steps.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:07.070
First, they spent three years as trainees,
doing prep work, cleaning, and running errands.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:10.440
Then, they would spend another
three years as journeymen

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:14.780
and be in charge of the backgrounds
or props of the pieces the master took on.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:19.360
And then, finally, they would be
registered as a master in their guild

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:22.690
and work as full-fledged painters.

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:24.650
Whoops, sorry!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.150
Not like that! How many times
do I have to tell you?

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.400
Do it properly!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.440
Yes, Master!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:34.070
The master was in an especially
bad mood today, huh?

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.900
I mean, we're really busy already,

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:40.360
but it looks like he took on work for
a new building and a court event, too.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.650
I'll help you.

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:48.190
Here.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:51.400
I'm glad you weren't hurt. Be careful!

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:57.230
U-Um, here! Take this as my thanks!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:59.940
Huh? Huh?

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:03.190
There you go again, making a pass at a girl.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:07.610
Huh? I was just helping her a little...

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:11.070
Yeah, I was just trying to help...

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:14.440
Why did that girl...?

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:18.070
How can you be so nice to girls?

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.030
How?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.650
I'm home!

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.610
Welcome back!

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.730
Oh, you're eating something!

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.030
Lucky!

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.230
Angelo, you're back just in time!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:35.690
Big Brother Angelo,
the leg of the bed is broken.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:39.400
Angelo, my feet are swollen.
Will you massage them?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.570
Um... one at a time...

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.360
I'll go in order, so just wait a minute.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.360
Gimme, gimme!

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:52.280
I was in the kitchen all day today, so I'm beat.

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:55.820
If only we could hire a servant.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:12:01.480
Because I'm so worthless,
my daughters will have a hard time.

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.650
Father...

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:06.360
I'm just a government official at town hall.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:11.320
I don't know if I'll be able to prepare
a dowry when those girls get married...

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:14.860
If we can't find good men to
marry them, then they'll struggle

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.320
for the rest of their lives.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:23.530
You, at least, should protect them
and be kind to them.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:29.230
Speaking of which, I heard a girl became
an apprentice at a painter's workshop.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.940
What? Even a girl can be a painter?

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.940
It's the first I've heard of it.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.860
Even though she's not a lady's maid,
or a seamstress, or a salesgirl,

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.230
she was hanging around the marketplace.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.280
A girl, by herself?

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:45.820
I think her name was... Arte...

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:50.570
I didn't think I'd hear
that girl's name again...

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:56.070
I'm a little traumatized
from her refusing my help...

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:58.110
Why can't I?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.940
Please!

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:02.980
It's that girl!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.570
Wh-Wh-Why is that girl here?!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:10.730
Please! I just want you to let me sketch
the sculpture in your workshop!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.360
It's something apprentices
from all workshops do!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.110
It's true, for <i>male</i> apprentices.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:22.690
It's a nuisance to have a girl
drawing for fun inside my workshop!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:26.940
You're in the way! Go home!

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:31.650
Hey, you lot! Hurry up and get to work! Jeez!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:42.980
Hey!

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:46.980
Um...

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:50.150
Oh, I met you when I was pulling that cart...

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:53.030
I'm sorry about how I acted back then!

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:58.440
Even though you had good intentions and
treated me kindly, I behaved rudely to you.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.980
Raise your head!
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:06.980
I remembered what happened later
and thought, "I was so rude!"

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:11.440
Huh? You repaired the shed by yourself?!

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:15.070
Yes! The hardest part was redoing the roof.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:19.780
I had to carry pieces of wood twice as big as me
to the roof and even climb on top.

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:26.150
Wow! That's amazing!
That would be hard even for a man to do!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.230
I wonder...

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.480
Thank you very much.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:37.070
Oh, um, are you doing well with your master?

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:42.610
Leo? He's a little scary, but I'm doing my best.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.150
A-About what happened earlier...

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.650
Do you want me to help get
you in to sketch the sculpture?

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:54.110
Huh? You mean...
you'll get me into the workshop?

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:57.280
I'll keep watch for times when it's a break,
or people aren't around,

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.360
and sneak you in from the back.

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:03.780
Because I don't think there's any way
Master Danilo will let you in...

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:06.360
And I want to help you.

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.860
So...

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:11.900
Um... Are you listening?

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:16.360
All right, I've decided!

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.110
Thank you very much, Angelo!

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:23.400
I'm going to try asking the master
one more time by myself!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:24.320
Huh?

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.110
What? Why? Did you hear what I just said?

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.320
Yes, um...

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.320
If I can't do a simple thing
like this by myself,

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:35.530
then I'll never be able to stand on my own.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:39.980
I understand, but you're
different from us, aren't you?

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.150
You're a girl.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:46.900
That has nothing to do with it.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:49.030
I want to become a painter.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:52.940
It's probably much, much harder
for me than for a man,

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:56.940
so I need to work that much harder by myself.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:08.780
Hm? What, you're here again?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:11.570
Please! Let me sketch your sculpture!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:12.400
No.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.320
I'll make sure not to get in anyone's way!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.690
I said, no!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:18.150
I won't give up no matter
how many times you say no!

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.940
"No" means "no"!

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.190
Please! Please!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:25.360
I'll help with the workshop! Please!

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:26.400
Be quiet!

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:27.980
Please!

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:34.900
Oof.

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:37.730
Will you help with <i>anything</i> ?

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.230
Huh? Yes.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:41.110
All right, then--

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:47.980
Carry these ten bags of clay
to the back storeroom.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:53.070
That's impossible. We can barely
carry those between two of us...

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.690
A girl wouldn't even be able to lift it.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:59.610
If I move those, then you will
let me sketch your sculpture?

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.610
Yeah.

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:03.230
Very well.

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.110
These, right?

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.650
It's no good, I can't lift it...

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:47.360
I can't...

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:56.780
I know! If I put my back
into it like that time...

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:34.320
Hey, you lot! Don't just stand
there watching! Get back to work!

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:37.070
Jeez.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.650
I-It's heavy...

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.730
But...

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:49.650
I'll definitely carry it...!

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:05.190
I did it!

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.730
And... done...

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.820
That was ten bags...

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:35.030
Wow... I can't believe she carried them all...

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:40.110
Master Danilo! You'll let me
sketch your sculpture now, right?

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:43.190
Y-Yeah...

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:45.280
Thank you very much!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.360
D-Don't tell me...

00:19:56.360 --> 00:20:00.230
...she's lost her grip strength
after all that heavy labor...

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:10.320
I don't know if you're amazing or idiotic!

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:13.070
That face--you look like
the world's about to end.

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:15.860
Miss, you did a good job.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:20.320
I like you. You can come back
to my workshop on a different day.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.570
Huh?

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.730
Thank you very much!

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:31.280
Thank you for walking with me.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:32.730
See you!

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:36.400
U-Um, I was thinking...

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:42.030
Master Danilo likes you, so why
don't you move to our workshop?

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.440
Then I can help you with anything you need,

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:49.110
and I'm sure everyone else will be
considerate of you as a girl, too.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:56.360
Thanks for the offer, but I want to
continue working at Leo's workshop.

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:59.610
What? Wh-Why would you...?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:07.110
Leo's strict with me not because I'm a girl,
but because I'm his apprentice.

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:10.530
I'm not looking for people to treat me kindly.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:12.440
I want people to be strict with me.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:15.070
It makes everything worth doing,

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:19.610
and every time I accomplish something,
I feel like I've grown as a person.

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:23.570
That's what I want!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.190
I'm home!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.400
Welcome home!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:41.280
Big Brother, the rocking
horse is broken. Fix it!

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:43.650
The nail here is sticking out...

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:46.070
Can you carry the bag of flour to the storeroom?

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.980
Massage my shoulders.

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:52.860
Everyone, why don't you try
doing it yourself first?

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:54.820
Huh?

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:58.280
If you do that, your life might open up...

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.690
Master, good night!

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:10.860
I'm sorry!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:23.400
I'll help you, so hurry up and clean that up!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:25.530
Y-Yes, sir!

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:59.500
"Preview"

00:23:56.900 --> 00:24:00.570
There are kind people like you
around, too, huh, Angelo?

00:24:00.570 --> 00:24:03.110
Tell me if you're having trouble! I'll help you!

00:24:03.110 --> 00:24:06.730
But I won't depend on you.
I'll do my best on my own!

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:11.050
"First Job"

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:08.730
Next time, "First Job."

00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:11.030
I have no choice but to do it!
